  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="0021C"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ier8">
        <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e98">Caput 8</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_1@1-3">In tempore illo,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e113">Omnia <pb ed="#P" n="0021D"/> quae prophetalis sermo describit, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e117" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_3@18-21">uque ad</quote> aurum et argentum quae in sepulcris more antiquo ponebantur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e125">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_4@1-2">Et dices.</quote>
            Post tanta mala ad poenitentiam provocat eos qui remanserunt. Sive, priusquam veniant, quae minatus est, hortatur ad conversionem, et poenitentiae locum indicat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e133">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e135" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_4@15-16">Aversus est,</quote>
            sive <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e138">avertit.</quote> Quasi dicat: Conversus potest irae Dei precibus resistere et avertere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e142">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e144">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_5@1-2">Quare ergo,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e151"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e152" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e155">Quanto eos ad poenitentiam provocavi, tanto magis recesserunt, non tam studio peccandi, quam me superandi.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e159">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e161">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e163">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e165" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_6@4-6">Nemo quod bonum,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e168" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen8_21@15-18">Omne g enus hominum pronum est ad malum</quote><ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e170"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e171" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref><!-- check: attribution inside gloss body -->. In <pb ed="#P" n="0022A"/> tempore Salvatoris, <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e177" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps13_3@1-11">omnes declinaverunt, simul inutiles facti sunt, non est qui faciat bonum</quote>. Unde ipse: <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e181" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps11_2@1-7">Salvum me fac, Domine, quoniam defecit sanctus</quote>. Ubi sunt ergo qui dicunt in nostra positum potestate omni peccato carere?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e187">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e189">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e191">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e193" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_7@1-3">Milvus in coelo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e196"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e197" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e200">Quasi dicat: Etiam aves sua norunt tempora, ut sciant quando ad calida festinantes loca rigorem hyemis declinare debeant, et veris principio ad solitas redire regiones.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e204">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e206">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e208">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e210" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_10@1-2">Propterea dabo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e213"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e214" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e217">Receperunt mercedem suam, et qui verbum Domini abjecerunt, ipsi abjecti sunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e221">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e223">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e225">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e227" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_11@1-3">Et sanabant contritionem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e230"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e231" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e234"><seg type="qs">Quasi dicat: Boni medici aliena vulnera verbis sanare cupiebant</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et ignominiam eorum qui decipiunt <pb ed="#P" n="0022B"/> dicentes, pax, pax, etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e247">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_12@14-15">Idcirco cadent.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e254"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e255" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e258">Ut quorum dignitas excellebat, etiam ruinae populi misceantur, quia scilicet <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e260" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier6_13@1-9">a minimo usque ad maximum omnes avaritiae student</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e266">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e268">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e270">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e272" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_13@6-8">Non est uva,</quote>
            etc. Quasi dicat: Cum tempora praetereant, et aestati succedat autumnus, et hyeme arborum cadant folia: de longe cuncta videbitis nec ex eis cibum capietis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e277">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e279">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e281">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e283" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_14@1-2">Quare sedemus.</quote>
            Vox populi inducitur respondentis, et vitia sua confitentis, et sese mutuo cohortantis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e287">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e289" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_14@3-7">Convenite et ingrediamur civitatem munitam.</quote>
            Vel unam civitatem Jerusalem: jam enim aliae captae fuerant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e295">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e297">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e299">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e301" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_16@1-4">A Dan auditus est.</quote>
            Ubi Jordanis fluvius <pb ed="#P" n="0022C"/> oritur: Nabuchodonosor describitur a Dan veniens per Phoenicem cum exercitu suo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e308">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e310">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e312">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e314" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_17@4-6">Mittam vobis serpentes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e317"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e318" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e321"><seg type="qs">Ut insanabiliter percutiant vos</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui eloquia Domini contemnunt traduntur adversariis potestatibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e330">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e332">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e334">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e336" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_18@1-2">Dolor meus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier8-Rd1e339"><name xml:id="gom-ier8-Nd1e340" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e343">Ex persona Domini haec legenda, eversionem Jerusalem plangentis, et ejus miseriam non ferentis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e347">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e349">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e351">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e353" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_19@1-2">Et ecce vox.</quote>
            Describit fletum et ululatum urbis ingressis hostibus. Hostes venientes de terra longinqua clamant contra civitatem vel cives contra hostes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e358">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e360">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e362">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e364" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_20@1-2">Transiit messis.</quote>
            Verba populi in Jerusalem longa obsidione conclusi, quia mutata sunt <pb ed="#P" n="0022D"/> tempora, anni circulus revolutus. Spes autem nostra irrita.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier8-Dd1e371">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier8-Hd1e373">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier8-d1e375">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier8-Qd1e377" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier8_21@1-2">Super contritione.</quote>
            Domini responsio, qui in afflictione Jerusalem videtur afflictus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
